title: The suspicion — parked, resumed, and read to the end
story: ides-of-march
author: Sharpee Platform
seed: 42
description: The poet's book-suspicion as a conversation he lets drift
  and always returns to. Steering off the subject parks it with his
  parting line; every return picks up where it stopped — same scene,
  or across a night and a room. The conclusion settles it, and the
  topic table reads the settlement.
  Run: node dist/cli/sharpee.js --test
    --story stories/ides-of-march/chord/ides-of-march.story
    stories/ides-of-march/tests/transcripts/threads-suspicion.transcript

